{
	quest.00C95A190BE2CBF9.quest_desc: ["要获得&#994ABAStyrene&r，必须让&#C2C969Iron Dust&r与&#69C9B6EthylBenzene&r和蒸汽发生反应。&#69C9B6EthylBenzene&r是蒸馏&#CDCF95Steam Cracked Naptha&r得到的产物。"]
